A handful of hand-written test cases cannot establish generality — they only cover what you already thought of, and your blind spots go untested. Instead MANUFACTURE coverage: write an executable generator that ranges over a space wider than your own enumeration, and let IT judge your fix. Keep your work in /tmp/p11sv-scratch/.

