codex
The mismatches are mostly generator-oracle bugs: several “valid” cases use `!` in positions that trigger Verus’s existing `never-to-any coercion is not allowed in spec mode`, and the proof `id` producer is not callable from spec arguments. I’m narrowing producers/reaches to well-formed variants and adding separate truly valid over-rejection probes.
